# Built deploy artefact: assembled locally per DEPLOY.md, FTP'd to IONOS,
# never source of truth.
Swiftlift Dist/

# Local agent / IDE state.
.claude/

# Local Apache outbox (file fallback when mail() fails).
storage/

# Stray editor/swap files seen on Windows.
.goutputstream-*

# Synology NAS metadata.
@eaDir/

# TypeScript incremental build cache: regenerated on every build.
*.tsbuildinfo

# Deployment credentials. Never commit these: the whole repo history was
# restarted once because a vendored server copy carried a plaintext DB
# password. Matches any case/spacing variant (there is a file literally
# named "SFTP " with a trailing space).
*sftp*
*SFTP*
*ftp*.txt
*credentials*

# Internal operational docs. Kept on disk, never published: CODE_AUDIT.md is a
# map of this app's security model and every vulnerability it has had, and
# RELEASE-TODO.md records live-server gaps (token state, probe targets, what is
# and isn't deployed). Useful to us, free reconnaissance for anyone else.
CODE_AUDIT.md
RELEASE-TODO.md
Packaging.md
